WEBVTT

00:39:26.372 --> 00:39:32.616
"Oh, end of history.
We figured out how to run societies."

00:39:33.236 --> 00:39:37.360
How much are we in need for

00:39:37.384 --> 00:39:41.564
a radically different political story,

00:39:41.588 --> 00:39:47.320
perhaps one based around ... you know,
with community at the center of it?

00:39:47.344 --> 00:39:51.099
Or is it better to think -- I mean,
you're a conservative.

00:39:51.123 --> 00:39:54.160
In general, you don't
believe in radical change.

00:39:54.184 --> 00:39:56.475
It's like, "Tinker gently
and carefully," right?

00:39:56.499 --> 00:39:58.422
DB: I'm a Burkean, yes.
CA: (Laughs) Yes.

00:39:58.446 --> 00:40:01.359
But you're sitting there
with what actually is, in some ways,